      "scope": "A bounded handhold feature fixture using the enclosure interfaces. The plain stock excludes quadrant seams, fluting and assembly attachments. It has not been physically printed or load tested.",
      "finding": "The retained native construction removes the old nonlinear section/sampling law. Its chamfer and conical mouth are intentional alternatives. The successful width/roof edit preserves the solved profile relationships. Earlier rolling-fillet and smooth-loft attempts were slow or refused; those attempts are recorded.",
      "note": "Functional geometry and editability are the goals. Surface variation from the Rust reference is allowed.",
      "machine": "https://homesodamachine.com/3d#step:manifold-layout%2Fenclosure-assembly.step?find=feature%3A%20enclosure-front-bottom%3A%3Awest-handhold"
    },
